# Files clang-format must not touch. Paths are relative to this file.
#
# config/ is not C++. A formatter reflowing grub.cfg once turned "set timeout=0" into
# "set timeout = 0", which GRUB parses as no assignment at all - the menu then waits forever
# for a keypress and the kernel never loads, silently and with no diagnostic.
config/*

# Vendored code is upstream's to format.
third_party/*
